WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.284
Multiples appear when you count by a number. The least common multiple is the first

00:00:05.284 --> 00:00:06.301
shared positive multiple.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:12.919
Find LCM(8, 6). The answer is 24. Least common multiple equals 24.

00:00:13.783 --> 00:00:18.701
Two bells at a market stall ring every 4 and 10 minutes. After how many minutes will

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:21.015
they ring together? Pause the video and think.

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:27.482
Two bells at a market stall ring every 4 and 10 minutes. After how many minutes will

00:00:27.482 --> 00:00:31.445
they ring together? The answer is 20. Least common multiple equals 20.
